# Execution Rules

## Ponytail gate

Before code edits: read `.cursor/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md`, trace the flow, climb the ladder, prefer deletion.

## Scope

Work only the approved phase. No unrequested refactors or file sprawl.

## Assumptions

If a decision is uncertain, stop and ask. Document only what gates cannot encode.

## Boundaries

Preserve layer boundaries; use `quality-pack` dependency-cruiser and import-linter starters in app repos.